# Build context exclusions. Keeping node_modules out matters for more than
# speed: the image must install from the committed lockfile rather than
# inherit whatever a developer's working tree happens to hold
# (docs/SECURITY.md section 19).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.claude
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
deploy/compose/secrets
docs
examples
*.log
